<!-- List of supported translation tables with meta-data.  The root element
     contains one or more table elements with the following attributes
     describing each table:

     id: Unique identifier.

     locale: for which this table is inteneded (on the form ll_CC_variant).

     dots: Number of dots: 6 *literary braille) or 8 (computer braille).

     grade: Contraction grade, only for 6 dot braille.

     variant: Table variant that helps user to distinguish certain table.

     fileName: liblouis table filename.  This attribute needs to be on
     its own line because of how it is being parsed by
     mktranslationtables.sh.
-->

